---
description: When writing tests or stories, look for fake data. Applies to *.test.ts*,*.stories.tsx
alwaysApply: true
---

When writing tests or Storybook stories and we need to create an object of a
certain type, prefer calling functions in `lib/testUtilities/ClientFakeData.ts`
or `lib/testUtilities/FakeData.ts`. Examples are:

- `ClientFakeData.makeFormDefinition()`
- `FakeData.makeDBUser()`
- `FakeData.makeDBFilledFormSet()`
- `FakeData.makeDBUploadedFile()`
